| `config_reads.test_helpers_root` | string | `tests` (required, no default in the loader) | a repo-relative directory with no `..` part or trailing `/` | `tests/integration/test_config_reads_gate.py` (`reads_policy`, `direct_reads`) | Names the directory whose direct Python helpers the config-reads gate walks alongside `config_reads.roots`; `conftest.py`, `test_*.py` and nested modules are left out because they read and write config to build fixtures. A missing or mistyped key fails by name. | recursive code-root walks: `config_reads.roots` | always |
